<title>USA: D.R. Horton credit facility now at $400 mln.</title>
<headline>D.R. Horton credit facility now at $400 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Texas 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>D.R. Horton Inc said Tuesday its unsecured bank credit facility, led by NationsBank Corp and BankAmerica Corp, has increased to $400 million.</p>
<p>The 12-member bank credit facility consists of a $100 million four-year term loan, a $275 million three-year revolving loan facility and a $25 million three-year letter of credit.</p>
<p>The company said the new financing will position it for future growth.</p>
<p>D.R. Horton is a builder of single-family homes.</p>
</text>
